                                        "entry_id": "688d4574-ebbb-3abf-8cbe-e3f2322db94d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "By or for the cause that; on this account that; for the reason that."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "72626c67-3023-41bf-9732-0ed737eb7025",
                                                "sense_id": "4af4de48-07e7-376c-9229-93640edf3bdb",
                                                "text": "I hid myself because I was afraid."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3beb68ed-442d-4423-892e-88ec731d2a1f",
                                                "sense_id": "4af4de48-07e7-376c-9229-93640edf3bdb",
                                                "text": "I was about to say that I had known the Celebrity from the time he wore kilts. But I see I will have to amend that, because he was not a celebrity then, nor, indeed, did he achieve fame until some time after I left New York for the West."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c71c5b38-1051-40bd-b81a-f55eab06d52c",
                                                "sense_id": "4af4de48-07e7-376c-9229-93640edf3bdb",
                                                "text": "In plants, the ability to recognize self from nonself plays an important role in fertilization, because self-fertilization will result in less diverse offspring than fertilization with pollen from another individual."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b5415969-9d6b-48f2-b655-2565cc2a9768",
                                                "sense_id": "4af4de48-07e7-376c-9229-93640edf3bdb",
                                                "text": "“Perhaps it is because I have been excommunicated. It's absurd, but I feel like the Jackdaw of Rheims.” ¶ She winced and bowed her head. Each time that he spoke flippantly of the Church he caused her pain."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "71c66452-bc54-385d-9cf8-0da92085bb36",
                                        "entry_id": "688d4574-ebbb-3abf-8cbe-e3f2322db94d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "As is known, inferred, or determined from the fact that."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8903a6af-217a-455a-a003-4eadaed88a86",
                                                "sense_id": "71c66452-bc54-385d-9cf8-0da92085bb36",
                                                "text": "I don't think he is a nice person, because he yells at people for no reason."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9ce3de6e-47b0-425c-9451-e758f1baf2c3",
                                                "sense_id": "71c66452-bc54-385d-9cf8-0da92085bb36",
                                                "text": "It must be broken, because I pressed the button and nothing happened."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c71ca247-aa9e-34cb-882c-99b7bb2576ef",
                                        "entry_id": "688d4574-ebbb-3abf-8cbe-e3f2322db94d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "So that, in order that."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "39c86b65-925e-4a84-aef2-0fd9e5b32a4b",
                                                "sense_id": "c71ca247-aa9e-34cb-882c-99b7bb2576ef",
                                                "text": "Simon[…]set the house on fire where he was born, because nobody should point at it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "because",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
