                                                "sense_id": "3ec69da3-3feb-3be5-b492-b3aa5d129785",
                                                "text": "You probably know it better, however, as explanation by way of Internet—explanation that maximizes efficiency and irony in equal measure. I'm late because YouTube. You're reading this because procrastination. As the language writer Stan Carey delightfully sums it up: “‘Because’ has become a preposition, because grammar.”"
                                            }
